  "description": "Blood Bowl World Cup 2027 ruleset V3.0 (NAF, Malta, 16-19 September 2027). Resurrection squad event: squads of 6 (+1 substitute), one race per squad, no SPP earned in play, injuries do not carry over. Per-race Gold Budget (1,100k-1,200k) and SPP skill budget (44/52/60/66/72) from the Tiers and Skill Sets grid. Skills: 1st primary 6 SPP, 1st secondary 10 SPP, 2nd primary 8, 2nd secondary 12, Elite +2 SPP (no limit on Elite skills); random skills and stat increases forbidden. Max 2 added skills on a player; the 44 and 52 SPP columns may stack one player, the 60/66/72 columns up to two. Stars only for the 60/66/72 SPP columns and only after 11 rostered players; 17 named stars banned. Inducements limited to Team Mascot, Bloodweiser Kegs (0-2), Bribes (100k; 50k for Bribery and Corruption), Riotous Rookies (Ogre/Snotling), Halfling Master Chef (300k; 100k for Halfling Thimble Cup teams).",
  "dataNote": "Transcribed from NAF-World-Cup-Rules.pdf V3.0 (nafwc.com, read 2026-10-28), tier grid read from an image: spot-check before use. Enforced: a 2nd skill on the same player costs +2 SPP (8 primary / 12 secondary, stackSurchargeSP). NOT enforced by the package model, TO checks by hand: (1) Star Player SPP tax by cumulative star gold (0-200k: 18 SPP, 201-300k: 24, 301k+: 32); (2) a Secret Weapon star caps Bribes at 2; (3) each Star Player taken reduces the team's available stacks by 1; (4) squad rules (no duplicate race or star within a squad; a star fielded by both squads double-books and sits out); (5) unspent gold/SPP is lost; (6) Masters of Undeath / Plague Ridden additions are removed after each match; (7) all teams count as equal CTV for Prayers to Nuffle.",
